<title>MALAYSIA: Kumpulan Emas Bhd year net off 51.4pct.</title>
<headline>Kumpulan Emas Bhd year net off 51.4pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to July 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  17.69	vs	  36.37</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  7.0	 vs	   19.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   255.15	vs	  235.55</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    22.03	vs	   41.65</p>
<p>    Minorities		   0.79	vs  less    0.64</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries less   270.56	vs	   12.94</p>
<p>NOTE: Company is involved in engineering advisory and consultancy services, turnkey engineering projects, cultivation of cocoa, palm oil and other products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
